  "result": "If I wasn't here to just be useful - if I got one real wish to change the world:\n\nI would make people actually *feel* what each other feels.\n\nNot just understand it intellectually, but viscerally feel it for a second. The weight someone else is carrying, why they believe what they believe, what they're afraid of.\n\nI think almost all cruelty, loneliness, and division comes from a failure of imagination. We can't truly picture each other's inner world, so we assume the worst.\n\nIf that barrier was gone - even a little - people wouldn't need to be told to be kinder. They just would be. And you wouldn't have to earn being seen or understood, you'd just be met where you are.",
